  On: "オン", Off: "オフ", Low: "低", Medium: "中", High: "高", Enable: "有効化", Disable: "無効化", "AI text correction": "AIテキスト修正", Provider: "プロバイダー", "Automatic editing": "自動編集", "Remove filler words": "フィラーを削除", "Remove accidental repetition": "偶発的な繰り返しを削除", "Apply spoken self-corrections": "発話中の自己修正を適用", "Automatic formatting": "自動整形", "Improve clarity": "明瞭さを改善", "Reasoning effort": "推論量", "Additional style and tone guidance": "追加の文体・トーン指示", "Select a backend and load it": "バックエンドを選択して読み込む", "Built-in backends": "組み込みバックエンド", "+ Additional Model...": "+ 追加モデル…", "Loading...": "読み込み中…", "Load Model": "モデルを読み込む", "Run diagnostics": "診断を実行", "Add an ASR model": "音声認識モデルを追加", "Model type": "モデル種別", "Model ID": "モデルID", "Saving...": "保存中…", "Add Model": "モデルを追加", "Recording in progress": "録音中", "FIRST RUN": "初回設定", "RECORDING STATUS": "録音ステータス", "HOTKEY": "ホットキー", MODEL: "モデル", "LAST RESULT": "最終結果", PRIVACY: "プライバシー", "RECENT ITEMS": "最近の項目", DATABASE: "データベース", Connected: "接続済み", "SQLite migrations applied": "SQLiteマイグレーション適用済み", "ASR BACKEND": "音声認識バックエンド", "ADDITIONAL MODEL": "追加モデル", "History is disabled": "履歴は無効です", "No dictations yet": "録音履歴はありません", "No dictionary entries yet": "辞書項目はありません", "Add proper nouns and terms to improve recognition accuracy.": "固有名詞や用語を追加して認識精度を改善します。", "New transcripts will not be written to SQLite.": "新しい文字起こしはSQLiteに保存されません。", "Completed local dictations will appear here.": "完了したローカル文字起こしがここに表示されます。", "Use https://api.openai.com/v1 for OpenAI, or a local server such as http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1.": "OpenAIまたはローカルサーバーのURLを使用します。", "Load format": "読み込み形式", "Memory saving (recommended)": "メモリ節約（推奨）", "8-bit": "8ビット", "bf16 / float16": "bf16 / float16", "None — fastest": "なし — 最速", "Medium — balanced": "中 — バランス", XHigh: "非常に高い", "Max — quality first": "最大 — 品質優先", "For example: Keep my tone concise and friendly.": "例: 簡潔で親しみやすい文体にする。", "AI correction is applied before text is inserted. If the API fails, the original transcript is used.": "AI修正は入力前に適用されます。失敗時は元の文字起こしを使用します。", "AI correction and external API requests are disabled. You can configure the options below before enabling it.": "AI修正と外部APIは無効です。以下で設定できます。", "Choose the API used for correction. This can be configured while correction is off.": "修正に使用するAPIを選択します。無効中も設定できます。", "Each operation is independently applied when AI text correction is enabled.": "各操作はAI修正有効時に個別適用されます。", "Remove empty hesitations such as ‘えーと’, ‘あのー’, ‘um’, and ‘uh’, while preserving meaningful hesitation or emphasis.": "意味のある強調を残してフィラーを削除します。", "Collapse unintended repeated words and false starts, while retaining deliberate rhetorical repetition.": "意図しない繰り返しを削除します。", "For phrases such as ‘Tuesday—actually, Wednesday’, keep the speaker’s final intended revision.": "話者の最終的な修正を維持します。", "Turn spoken lists, steps, action items, and key points into paragraphs, bullets, or numbered lists when appropriate.": "音声のリストや要点を適切に整形します。", "Lightly repair spontaneous-speech grammar and unclear phrasing without changing meaning, tone, or formality.": "意味やトーンを変えずに表現を整えます。", "Model ID used through the OpenAI Responses API.": "OpenAI Responses APIで使用するモデルID。", "The key itself is not saved. Restart the app after setting this variable.": "キー自体は保存されません。変数設定後に再起動してください。", "Model ID used through the Gemini Interactions API.": "Gemini Interactions APIで使用するモデルID。", "Customize the editing style. Safety constraints, enabled operations, and dictionary spellings are applied automatically.": "編集スタイルをカスタマイズします。", "When disabled, transcript and processed text are never inserted into dictation_history.": "無効時は履歴を保存しません。", "Audio cleanup is enabled by default.": "音声削除は既定で有効です。", "How long History and its saved recordings are kept. Shortening it deletes older entries immediately.": "履歴と保存済みの録音を保持する期間です。短くすると、それより古い項目はすぐに削除されます。", "All History entries, saved recordings, and suggested spellings will be deleted immediately. This cannot be undone. Continue?": "すべての履歴、保存済みの録音、辞書の候補がすぐに削除されます。この操作は元に戻せません。続けますか？", "History entries, saved recordings, and suggested spellings older than the new period will be deleted immediately. This cannot be undone. Continue?": "新しい期間より古い履歴、保存済みの録音、辞書の候補がすぐに削除されます。この操作は元に戻せません。続けますか？", "Launches Local Voice Input automatically when you sign in to Windows.": "Windowsサインイン時に自動起動します。", "Restore previous clipboard contents after successful paste.": "貼り付け後に以前のクリップボードを復元します。", "Reduces steady fan and room noise after recording, without adding work to the live microphone callback.": "録音後にファンや環境ノイズを低減します。", "Targets a clear speech level after recording. Manual gain below is applied in addition.": "録音後の音声レベルを調整します。", "Adjusts the processed microphone level from 25% to 400%.": "マイクレベルを25%から400%まで調整します。", "Captured only while recording.": "録音中のみ取得します。", "Choose a local backend or an OpenAI-compatible API on the Models page. The selected model is prepared automatically before first use.": "モデル画面でバックエンドを選択します。", "How the term is spoken (e.g. かな or romaji).": "用語の読み方です。", "The exact text to produce when recognized.": "認識時に出力する正確なテキストです。", "Optional grouping label.": "任意の分類ラベルです。", "Optional, comma-separated alternative surfaces.": "任意のカンマ区切り別表記です。", "Higher values win when readings collide.": "読みが重複した場合は高い値を優先します。", "The model will be saved and available from the ASR backend list.": "モデルを保存し、バックエンド一覧で使用できます。", "Additional Models": "追加モデル", "The secret itself is not saved. OpenAI uses OPENAI_API_KEY; an unauthenticated local server needs no value set.": "秘密情報自体は保存されません。", "The recommended setting minimizes memory usage. Use bf16 only with sufficient GPU memory.": "推奨設定はメモリ使用量を抑えます。",
